    "H3_reason": "Saturn closed-loop is 0/150 on the mass-floor + reactor-lifetime axes (titan-6). Hybrid power shortens inbound BURN TIME only (propellant is fixed by Tsiolkovsky, independent of power); it does not reduce vehicle dry mass and so cannot relieve the mass-floor kill. The burn-time / reactor-hours benefit is bounded and helps round-trip + lifetime margin, not the binding mass constraint.",
